Subject: [PATCH] Add native Intuition frontend for the original PdfCraft egui
 app

Reuse WordCraft shell source 02628f1ca3f0a5577aa3601b7e5f390bab398fc8, including input, CPU rasterizer and repaint fixes. Expose frame methods while preserving eframe forwarding elsewhere; add ASL/text-clipboard adapters with ownership checks and explicit unsupported image/file-list operations. Native GUI linked; actual GUI acceptance pending. No branded logos embedded for AROS.
